# Optional. Enables the live contribution-calendar heatmap in the GitHub
# section. Without it, that section falls back to a clean "view on GitHub"
# link instead of breaking or showing stale data.
#
# Create one at https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta
# Fine-grained token, no repo access needed — just the "read:user" scope
# under Account permissions. Add it in Vercel under
# Project Settings -> Environment Variables, not in this file.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
